      Power: <b>${(c.skill.mult + c.skill.perLv*(skmLvl-1)).toFixed(2)}×</b> attack · MP ${c.skill.mp} · CD ${c.skill.cd}s<br>
      ${cost ? `<button class="btn gold" id="skUp">Upgrade — ${cost} gold</button>` : `<span style="color:#ffd75a">MAX LEVEL</span>`}`;
